  "reviewNotes": "Lettered image inspected at source size. Neon is fixed tube above barman; rain is limited to clear pane. Bat remains immutable; residual dust is a single narrative fall. A separate local floor reflection animates c3 after dust stops. Glass falls once in clear right-hand opening, with independent rain beyond it. No lightSweep, no body warp. Explicit hand/eye/balloon protections are restored after all effects. Revision2: optional elliptical softEdge makes halo zero at region boundaries; p05 tube region narrowed to actual tube and clear of protected barman head. Previous plan preserved in master effects-plan-v1.json. Revision3: floor reflection removed entirely at owner request; replaced by tiny neutral airborne dust in free floor patch left of barman, above bat and clear of cadets. No luminous band remains. Revision4: actual event pixel test found only20dustpixels because former region was mostly protected; dust fall moved to clear floor strip left of barman and above bat (617,861,61,52), no protection removed.",
